WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.389 --> 00:00:06.190
Today, we looked at some of Twinmotion's additional features to complement the basics.

2
00:00:07.169 --> 00:00:12.269
You learned about tools that give you more flexibility when dealing with animation and general productivity.

3
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:17.500
You learned about lighting and experimented with man-made lights to support night scenes.

4
00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:25.489
From there, you learned about media output and how to set up still images, panoramas and videos to export to disk.

5
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:32.109
You also learned to export self-executable presentations that you can share with your clients and audience.

6
00:00:32.609 --> 00:00:36.909
With that, others can enjoy your work without needing to have Twinmotion installed.

7
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:44.020
Finally, you learned to work in Phases, which is capturing an animation of the phases of construction of your project.

8
00:00:45.409 --> 00:00:48.909
I hope you have learned something useful that you can apply to your work.
